---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';

const updated = '2026-03-15';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description={`Terms of Use for ${siteConfig.name}: acceptable use, intellectual property, disclaimers, and liability limits.`}
  showSearch={false}
>
  <article class="container-arcade prose-arcade legal-doc w-full max-w-4xl py-8 sm:py-10">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-arcade-muted">
      Effective / last updated: <time datetime={updated}>{updated}</time>
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4 rounded-lg border border-arcade-border/60 bg-arcade-card/80 p-4 text-sm text-arcade-muted">
      These Terms of Use (“Terms”) form a binding agreement between you and{' '}
      <strong class="text-white">{siteConfig.legalName}</strong> governing access to and use of{' '}
      <a href={siteConfig.url}>{siteConfig.url}</a> (the “Site”). By accessing or using the Site, you agree to
      these Terms and our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree, do not use the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Eligibility &amp; audience</h2>
    <p>
      The Site is intended for a <strong>general audience</strong> and is not directed to children under{' '}
      {siteConfig.minimumRecommendedAge}. If you are under the age of majority where you live, you may use the
      Site only with involvement of a parent or guardian. You represent that you have the legal capacity to
      accept these Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Description of the service</h2>
    <p>
      {siteConfig.name} provides discovery tools (search, categories, editorial notes, and related navigation)
      for free HTML5 / browser games. Playable game files are typically hosted by third parties and loaded in a
      sandboxed frame after you choose to play. We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability of any title.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Accounts</h2>
    <p>
      The Site does not require registration. Optional features such as “continue playing” or favorites are stored
      locally in your browser and are not a hosted account service.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Violate any applicable law or third-party right</li>
      <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, scrape aggressively, reverse engineer, or bypass security controls on the Site</li>
      <li>Interfere with advertising systems, generate invalid ad clicks/impressions, or encourage others to click ads</li>
      <li>Upload or transmit malware, or attempt unauthorized access to systems or data</li>
      <li>Misrepresent your identity or affiliation in communications with us</li>
      <li>Use the Site to distribute infringing copies of software, games, or other copyrighted works</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
    <h3>5.1 Our materials</h3>
    <p>
      The Site’s branding, layout, original text, and selection/arrangement of materials are owned by{' '}
      {siteConfig.legalName} or its licensors and are protected by intellectual property laws. You may not copy
      or exploit them except as needed for personal, non-commercial use of the Site or as allowed by law.
    </p>
    <h3>5.2 Third-party games</h3>
    <p>
      Games, trademarks, artwork, audio, and code remain the property of their respective owners. Listing or
      embedding a game does <strong>not</strong> transfer any ownership to you or to us. If you believe content
      on the Site infringes your rights, see our <a href="/dmca/">DMCA / Copyright Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Third-party services &amp; embeds</h2>
    <p>
      The Site may link to or embed third-party websites, games, and advertisements. We do not control and are
      not responsible for third-party content, availability, privacy practices, or terms. Your use of third-party
      services is at your own risk and subject to those parties’ terms.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      The Site may display advertisements, including via Google AdSense. Ads are labeled where served by us and
      placed away from primary play controls to reduce accidental clicks. Third-party game hosts may show their
      own ads inside embeds. Advertising partners’ collection and use of data are described in our Privacy Policy.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Content standards</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to keep a family-oriented, general-audience catalog and may remove or refuse listings that appear to
      violate law, our <a href="/content-policy/">Content Policy</a>, or third-party rights. Removal decisions are
      discretionary and do not create an obligation to monitor all third-party content continuously.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Disclaimers</h2>
    <p>
      THE SITE AND ALL CONTENT, GAMES, AND SERVICES ARE PROVIDED <strong>“AS IS”</strong> AND <strong>“AS AVAILABLE”</strong>
      WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS, IMPLIED, OR STATUTORY, INCLUDING IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF
      MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, TITLE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE
      SITE OR ANY GAME WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, SECURE, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE OF HARMFUL COMPONENTS.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, {siteConfig.legalName.toUpperCase()} AND ITS OPERATORS, AFFILIATES,
      AND SUPPLIERS SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR PUNITIVE
      DAMAGES, OR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, GOODWILL, OR OTHER INTANGIBLE LOSSES, ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO YOUR
      USE OF (OR INABILITY TO USE) THE SITE OR ANY THIRD-PARTY GAME OR SERVICE. OUR TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ANY CLAIM
      ARISING OUT OF THESE TERMS OR THE SITE SHALL NOT EXCEED ONE HUNDRED U.S. DOLLARS (US $100) OR THE MINIMUM
      AMOUNT PERMITTED BY LAW, WHICHEVER IS GREATER IN YOUR JURISDICTION WHERE SUCH CAP IS RESTRICTED.
    </p>
    <p>
      Some jurisdictions do not allow certain limitations; in those cases, our liability is limited to the fullest
      extent permitted by law.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Indemnity</h2>
    <p>
      You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless {siteConfig.legalName} and its operators from and against
      claims, damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys’ fees) arising out of your misuse of
      the Site, your violation of these Terms, or your violation of any third-party right.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Copyright complaints</h2>
    <p>
      We respond to notices of alleged copyright infringement in accordance with applicable law. See{' '}
      <a href="/dmca/">DMCA / Copyright</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>13. Termination</h2>
    <p>
      We may suspend or terminate access to the Site at any time, including for conduct we believe violates these
      Terms or creates risk for users, us, or third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>14. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may modify these Terms by posting an updated version on the Site with a new effective date. Continued use
      after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
    </p>

    <h2>15. Governing law</h2>
    <p>
      These Terms are governed by {siteConfig.governingLaw}, without regard to conflict-of-law principles, except
      where mandatory consumer protections in your country of residence provide otherwise.
    </p>

    <h2>16. Severability &amp; entire agreement</h2>
    <p>
      If any provision is held unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect. These Terms, together with
      the Privacy Policy, Content Policy, and DMCA Policy, constitute the entire agreement between you and us regarding
      the Site.
    </p>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>
